| `cargo fmt --all -- --check` | pass |
| `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` | pass, 0 warnings |
| `cargo test --all-targets` | **525 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored** (+ `cargo test --doc`: 1) |
| `./rbops/verify.sh phase-020` | not run — does not exist here (FINDINGS §6); examples + modules run clean (8/8) |

No test deleted, no `#[ignore]`, no `allow`. 3 tests added (differential 16→17, property 12→14). All eight defects mutation-checked — putting each back fails a named test. Corpus regeneration is byte-identical.
